{"id":"1f06ef5177a12879","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-random-stochastic.md","title":"随机性蕴含可计算选择下的频率稳定","display":"thm-random-stochastic — 随机性蕴含可计算选择下的频率稳定","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-random-stochastic","aliases":["43-thm-random-stochastic"],"display":"thm-random-stochastic — 随机性蕴含可计算选择下的频率稳定","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-comprandom]]","[[43-df-church-stochastic]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§12.1 Theorem 12.1.3，印刷327，PDF347","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-random-stochastic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-random-stochastic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-random-stochastic — 随机性蕴含可计算选择下的频率稳定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"00b50f9887ef4bac\" href=\"?note=00b50f9887ef4bac\" title=\"43-df-church-stochastic\">43-df-church-stochastic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12.1 Theorem 12.1.3，印刷327，PDF347"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；随机性与选择频率见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"00b50f9887ef4bac\" href=\"?note=00b50f9887ef4bac\" title=\"43-df-church-stochastic\">43-df-church-stochastic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{VMCWStochastic}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{VMCWStochastic}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComputableRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ChurchStochastic}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ComputableRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ChurchStochastic}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选择规则的持续偏差产生只在被选位置下注的策略；部分规则给有效策略，总规则给可计算策略。</p>\n<p>来源：§12.1 Theorem 12.1.3，印刷327，PDF347。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","lo